menu "ESP Base WASM"

    config ESP_BASE_TEST_WASM_BENCH
        bool "Test build only: run the WASM memory benchmark instead of the system"
        default n
        help
            The firmware loads an embedded sample application, prints heap and stack usage for
            each phase, and never starts the system layer (no Wi-Fi, no broker). Used only to
            measure the runtime on a board or in QEMU; release packaging refuses images built
            with it.

    config ESP_BASE_TEST_WASM_DEPLOY
        bool "Test build only: run the scripted application deployment test instead of the system"
        default n
        help
            The firmware never starts the system layer (no Wi-Fi, no broker). It deploys the
            application packages that the test script placed in flash, one after another, through
            the regular slots, signature checks, trial, commit and rollback; only the download is
            replaced by a copy from flash. Used by tools/wasm_deploy_qemu.py; release packaging
            refuses images built with it.

endmenu
